fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecs/gsth266decoder.html#gst_h266_dpb_bump","fragment":"\n\tgst_h266_dpb_bump\n\n\n\tGstCodecs.H266Dpb.prototype.bump\n\n\n\tGstCodecs.H266Dpb.bump\n\nPerform bumping process as defined in C.5.2.4 \"Bumping\" process.\nIf drain is TRUE, dpb will remove a GstH266Picture from internal array\nso that returned GstH266Picture could hold the last reference of it.\nParameters:\na GstH266Dpb\nwhether draining or not\na GstH266Picture which is needed to be\noutputted\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nPerform bumping process as defined in C.5.2.4 \"Bumping\" process.\nIf drain is true, dpb will remove a GstCodecs.H266Picture from internal array\nso that returned GstCodecs.H266Picture could hold the last reference of it.\nParameters:\na GstCodecs.H266Dpb\nwhether draining or not\na GstCodecs.H266Picture which is needed to be\noutputted\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nPerform bumping process as defined in C.5.2.4 \"Bumping\" process.\nIf drain is True, dpb will remove a GstCodecs.H266Picture from internal array\nso that returned GstCodecs.H266Picture could hold the last reference of it.\nParameters:\na GstCodecs.H266Dpb\nwhether draining or not\na GstCodecs.H266Picture which is needed to be\noutputted\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});